WEBVTT

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:08.170
The expedition's set for eight days from now!
You guys ready for this trek?!

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.290
Those monsters don't scare us!

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:24.000
Aria, go to Level 59.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:27.000
There, you should find the answer to what you seek.

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.250
Before I do that...

00:00:34.330 --> 00:00:36.130
I need to apologize.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:40.580
I'll return this, and then this time, for sure...

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:03.170
If you search for the things you lack with downcast eyes

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:06.880
You'll never discover incredible places like this

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:13.130
Let's get rid of these vague standards

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:18.170
And the courage will spread through you

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:23.710
A world without lies reflects in your eyes

00:01:23.710 --> 00:01:27.920
Throw away the useless bravado and

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:32.540
Let's laugh and cry together

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:36.380
We played the strings at our own speed

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:38.580
And embellished how we wished

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:43.540
When you're around miracles can happen RE-ILLUSION

00:01:43.830 --> 00:01:46.250
We shined and lit each other up

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:51.000
On the other side our dreams melded together

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.210
We created a synergy and

00:01:53.420 --> 00:02:00.920
With our strong and genuine bond we crossed the world

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.130
That Bell!

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:15.710
I can't believe he ran away screaming

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:18.130
without even a thank you. So rude!

00:02:18.130 --> 00:02:21.380
Well, I wanted to return this to him personally.

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.880
Very well.

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:27.130
Please allow me to assist you.

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:29.130
We'll need to make sure he doesn't run off...

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:32.130
Wait, let's plan this out so that he CAN'T run away!

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:36.330
Hmm... Maybe I could lock him up
in one of the meeting rooms.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.880
Umm...

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:40.750
Bell?

00:02:45.330 --> 00:02:46.540
Wai-! Bell!

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:48.830
Hey, watch it.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:50.670
S-sorry!

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:58.920
You were attacked by Orcs in the Dungeon
the other day, weren't you?

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:04.500
You dropped this when you left,
so I wanted to return it.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.960
Then, that was you who saved me?

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.330
I've wanted to apologize to you.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:11.080
Huh?

00:03:11.880 --> 00:03:17.210
You were hurt badly
by that Minotaur I let escape.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:19.170
I'm sorry.

00:03:19.170 --> 00:03:21.790
W-wait a sec!

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:27.210
You did nothing wrong, Miss Wallenstein!
I mean, you saved my life that day!

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:32.580
I-I'm the one who should be apologizing
for running away without thanking you!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:34.330
Forgive me!

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.960
Finally... I was able to apologize.

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:47.250
It's amazing you made it down to Level 10
in such a short amount of time.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:50.040
N-no! Not at all!

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:53.830
I need to become stronger,
but I've still got a long way to go.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:56.040
My combat skills are amateur at best...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:59.920
You don't have anyone to teach you to fight?

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.580
N-not really...

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:06.460
Well...

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:09.170
Why don't I teach you, then?

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:10.290
Huh?

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.500
I've got to know how this guy is improving so fast.

00:04:18.710 --> 00:04:20.960
I have to ask Ais today, no matter what.

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:24.460
The foes we fought on Level 24 were powerful...

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:28.170
But there are bound to be even stronger enemies
in the deeper levels.

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:32.630
I don't want to slow anyone down.
I want to be stronger.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.330
And to do that...

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.330
Train in... swordfighting?

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:42.040
Yes! I want to learn how to use
Concurrent Chanting. Please!

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:45.540
Wow, Lefiya. That's brilliant.

00:04:48.040 --> 00:04:50.290
No, you're just saying that!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.250
Lefiya?

00:04:53.670 --> 00:04:55.500
M-Miss Ais!

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:58.630
Is something wrong?

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.460
N-no, no! Nothing at all!

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.420
I still couldn't say it...

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.000
When Miss Ais gets here...

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:18.960
I'll walk up and say,
"Oh, what a coincidence! I'm practicing too."

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:20.920
Yep. This is going to work!

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.170
Miss Ais?

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.420
M-Miss Ais! Don't go!

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:38.000
I think she came this way.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.250
I'm s-so sorry!

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.500
O-oh no! Are you all right?

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.250
Thank you. I'm so sorry about that.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:56.000
N-no... It was my fault.

00:05:56.250 --> 00:06:01.380
Oh, right! Have you seen the Sword Princess,
Ais Wallenstein pass by?

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.830
You wouldn't happen to be... one of Loki Familia's...

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.460
I am, actually...

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:11.210
I-I'M SORRY!

00:06:11.540 --> 00:06:15.130
S-something's fishy.
That kid's definitely hiding something!

00:06:16.040 --> 00:06:17.420
Hold it!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:39.210
If I can figure out the secret behind his progress,
it might make me stronger...

00:06:40.040 --> 00:06:44.000
But... that would mean I'm only using him...

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.290
I'll pay him back. It's the least I can do.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:55.460
G-goo... g-good morning...

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:57.080
Is everything all right?

00:06:57.080 --> 00:07:01.130
Yeah... Just got chased by a Woodland Fairy is all...

00:07:05.790 --> 00:07:08.290
Where'd that Human run off to?

00:07:09.960 --> 00:07:11.210
Wait, that couldn't be...

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:22.790
What's the matter with her?

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:24.380
Beats me.

00:07:26.040 --> 00:07:27.080
Lefiya?

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:31.290
Um, are you okay?

00:07:35.290 --> 00:07:36.420
Miss Ais...

00:07:37.920 --> 00:07:42.420
What's with that Human
you met in secret this morning, huh?

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:45.670
Lefiya, how do you know about that?

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:51.710
L-Lefiya!

00:07:52.790 --> 00:07:54.210
The hell was that?

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.630
No idea...

00:07:57.710 --> 00:08:03.330
So, you agreed to teach that Human
how to fight until we leave on our expedition?

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:05.210
That's why you were together?

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.710
Then... then how come he was leaning all over you?!

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:11.210
Oh...

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:14.790
He couldn't walk anymore, so I lent him my shoulder...

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:17.130
Oh, is that all?

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:23.380
Wh-who does he think he is, begging Miss Ais
to teach him when he's not even in our Familia?!

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:28.130
The thought of him getting special
one-on-one training makes me so jealous!

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:30.790
The nerve of that guy!

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:33.790
Please don't tell the others, Lefiya.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.630
O-on one condition!

00:08:38.630 --> 00:08:41.250
If you don't listen, I... I'll tell everyone!

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:45.380
Please give me special training
just like that Human!

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.790
J-just the two of us!

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:50.170
If you're fine with me as a teacher...

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.500
Th-then, you'll do it?

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.670
Sure, that's fine with me.

00:08:57.130 --> 00:09:03.630
Woohoo! I get to do one-on-one training
with Miss Ais! Yay!

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:12.210
Today's the day I get to start training with Miss Ais!
My very own lessons!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:14.670
I was so excited I even woke up early!

00:09:14.670 --> 00:09:18.330
Oh, but she's probably
with that Human right about now...

00:09:20.580 --> 00:09:23.040
I wonder what kind of training they're doing?

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.380
Oops, I did it again...

00:09:34.830 --> 00:09:36.580
It's just like that other time...

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:44.750
It's not like I care what they're doing anyway.
I'm not even curious.

00:09:46.380 --> 00:09:49.880
I know! I'll ask her to train me
even harder than that Human.

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:51.330
I can see it now...

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:56.210
I'm all right, Miss Ais! Come at me harder!

00:10:00.540 --> 00:10:01.880
Go ahead.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:05.750
In my dreams! As if that would ever happen!

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.250
I'm ready, Miss Ais!

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.960
L-Lefiya?

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:22.460
I'm going to try some Concurrent Chanting,
so don't hold back!

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:23.210
No mercy!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:25.420
Here I go!

00:10:27.880 --> 00:10:29.670
Sorry, Lefiya.

00:10:29.670 --> 00:10:32.500
I slashed you thinking I was still training with him.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.790
I'm okay! Let's keep going!

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:38.710
One more time-

00:10:41.630 --> 00:10:42.500
One more...

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:47.580
Should we take a break?

00:10:51.170 --> 00:10:55.170
Miss Ais, how are things going
with that Human, anyway?

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.710
With him? Well...

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:02.500
He's really focused, he tries really hard,
he's really honest,

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:05.380
and he improves really fast.

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:07.170
I think he's got potential.

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.670
I'm not even improving at all...

00:11:12.040 --> 00:11:15.330
What? Throwin' in the towel so soon?

00:11:15.670 --> 00:11:20.580
Welp, more for me then! La la la...

00:11:27.330 --> 00:11:29.380
I'm not gonna lose to that twerp!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.000
Miss Ais! Let's keep going!

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:37.880
Hey, Riveria. What's Lefiya been up to lately?

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:41.210
I would ask you two the same thing.

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.670
We were sparring. Sparring!

00:11:43.670 --> 00:11:47.290
Ais got to Rank Up before we could. Can you blame us?

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:49.460
Think Lefiya's been training up too?

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:52.170
I can't think of anywhere else she'd be...

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:55.250
Perhaps she found herself a good rival.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:57.710
But first things first...

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.290
You're so good at that, Riveria.

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:09.170
It came naturally, taking care of Ais for so long.
Though it gave me a lot of trouble in the past.

00:12:09.420 --> 00:12:13.000
You mean when Ais first joined the Familia?

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:13.880
Yes.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.000
Itty bitty Ais, huh?

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:18.670
Oh, you must have heard of Aria then, right?

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:20.670
Aria?

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:24.460
Yeah. Lefiya said that's what the Tamer called Ais.

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:28.540
Do you think all of these strange incidents
could somehow be connected to Ais?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:31.540
Level 59...

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.380
...I think we'll find the answer there.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.830
Man, I sure am glad this expedition
isn't gonna break the bank after all!

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:46.330
If Ais hadn't donated her earnings from the other day
to the Familia fund, this could have been bad.

00:12:46.880 --> 00:12:49.580
From that quest on Level 24, right?

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:54.920
Forkin' over a huge pile o' treasure like that...
Who WAS that, anyway?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.580
We're coming in!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:03.210
Oh, Loki! Finn!

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.000
It's been a while, Tsubaki.

00:13:05.460 --> 00:13:08.130
Those look just as juicy as I remember them!

00:13:08.130 --> 00:13:11.580
Heh, if you want 'em that bad you can have 'em.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:13.750
All they do is get in the way when I'm working the forge.

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:16.290
I'd take yours over mine any day.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:21.130
So what brings you here today?

00:13:21.540 --> 00:13:24.330
Meeting with our Lady Hephaistos
about the expedition?

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.420
I heard you'll be joining us as well.

00:13:26.540 --> 00:13:30.830
Yep, I want to check out some new scenery
in the deeper levels.

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:36.330
And if luck's on my side, I'm hoping to procure
some nice dropped items to use for armor.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:39.920
I'll feel better having a high-level smith like you around.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.420
We'll be counting on you.

00:13:42.130 --> 00:13:43.670
How are those Durandal weapons coming along?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.000
Without a hitch.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.710
Everything's ready to go, just as you ordered.

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.920
Speaking of which, you sure
you don't want any magic weapons?

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:55.210
Hephaistos Familia magic weapons
are certainly the finest quality around...

00:13:55.750 --> 00:13:59.130
I want them so badly I can taste it, to be honest.

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.750
Those price tags, though...!

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.460
Money, huh...?

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.080
Hm? What's up?

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:09.460
Well, we've actually got somebody
who can make some incredible magic weapons.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:13.960
Bit eccentric, though. Refuses to make 'em
no matter how much coin customers throw at him.

00:14:14.210 --> 00:14:17.170
Yeah, sounds like a real oddball.

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.170
Thank you so much for today, Miss Ais!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.920
Is training with me helping you at all?

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.750
You keep passing out, so I thought...

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:32.290
O-of course it is! I'll try my best again tomorrow!

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.580
I refuse to be bested by that Human!

00:14:35.790 --> 00:14:39.420
Sorry, Lefiya. Could we take a day off tomorrow?

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.630
What?

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:45.790
He's an outsider! An outsider!
He's not even in our Familia!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:49.000
How dare he monopolize Miss Ais for a whole day!

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.920
The nerve! I can't believe him!

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:52.670
It should be me, not him!

00:14:54.630 --> 00:14:58.210
I-it's unforgiveable! That shameless jerk...!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:14:59.130
Viridis?

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:11.380
I'd like to thank you once again for taking such
good care of my dear Filvis on Level 24, Lefiya Viridis.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:17.000
N-not at all! I should thank Miss Filvis
for coming to my rescue so many times!

00:15:17.540 --> 00:15:18.710
Please, enjoy.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:20.670
Thank you.

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:27.170
It's amazing!

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:33.330
Filvis has been quite taken with you
since that trip, you know.

00:15:33.330 --> 00:15:36.540
She's been chattering happily about you non-stop.

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:37.580
What?

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:40.630
I... I was only giving you a report...

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:42.040
My apologies.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:45.290
So, where are you off to this fine day?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.830
Umm, actually...

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:51.080
I had something important planned,
but now that's cancelled.

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.250
I was thinking of doing some
solo training in the Dungeon...

00:15:55.380 --> 00:15:57.630
Your dedication is admirable.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:00.630
Filvis, why don't you go along with her?

00:16:00.630 --> 00:16:02.630
But Lord Dionysus...

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:05.960
Don't worry about me.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.960
Go and lend her your strength.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:12.830
Lefiya Viridis, I hope you'll continue
to get along with my Filvis.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:16.830
It makes me happy when I see her smile.

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:27.580
So now today, that darn Human,

00:16:27.580 --> 00:16:30.040
he's monopolizing Miss Ais
even though he's an outsider!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:32.210
No shame at all! So greedy!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:38.170
I see. But, are you sure
you really want to train with me?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:39.380
What?

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:44.000
I can't begin to compare to the Sword Princess
when it comes to swordfighting.

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:48.630
That's not true! Your Concurrent Chanting
the other day was amazing!

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:56.920
The whole reason I wanted to practice Concurrent
Chanting was because I wanted to be as great as you...

00:16:57.250 --> 00:16:58.670
You overestimate me.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:17:01.080
Besides, as a pure mage,

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:06.460
your nature and your role in battle differ greatly
from my own as a magic swordswoman.

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:09.500
As much as I'd love to help you...

00:17:12.500 --> 00:17:13.830
That's it.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:16.250
We should approach this using your specialty instead...

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:17.420
Viridis...

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:19.170
Do away with the idea of the counterattack.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:23.540
What? B-but then what would be the point
of Concurrent Chanting?

00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.170
You're asking to fail
if you depend on hastily prepared spells.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:32.040
It's better to concentrate on avoiding attacks
while you focus on your incantation.

00:17:33.960 --> 00:17:39.960
Protecting yourself until the spell is activated...
that is a brilliant way to use Concurrent Chanting.

00:17:44.460 --> 00:17:45.630
I'll do it.

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:47.830
Right. Let's put it to the test.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.080
Okay!

00:17:56.710 --> 00:17:58.040
May I ask you something?

00:18:00.080 --> 00:18:03.540
S-sorry...! I keep passing out on you...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:07.500
How are you able to grow so strong so quickly?

00:18:07.670 --> 00:18:10.710
Huh?! I-I'm not strong at all...

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:15.710
Well... it's just, um...

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:19.750
There's, um... someone I just have to catch up to.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:24.330
There's a place I have to reach, no matter what.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.670
That's what I think, anyway...

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:30.080
I see.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.920
I understand. It's the same for me.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:34.460
Father...

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:40.710
Mother...!

00:18:48.170 --> 00:18:49.210
Wait for me...

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.290
Someday, I'll...!

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:57.170
Fire, O Elven archer.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:00.460
May your arrow strike true! Arcs Ray!

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:07.210
You're getting better.

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.750
Thank you!

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:13.040
Thanks to your help, Miss Filvis, I can...!

00:19:13.210 --> 00:19:18.830
No, the foundation was there already.
It's your own hard work that did it, Viridis.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:21.710
Uh, um... Miss Filvis?

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:22.880
Yes?

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.040
It's just...

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:32.960
Do you think that from now on...
you could call me Lefiya?

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:36.790
I-I can't.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:38.040
Please!

00:19:38.040 --> 00:19:39.290
I'm saying it's not possible!

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:40.460
You can make an exception!

00:19:40.460 --> 00:19:41.330
You're so stubborn!

00:19:41.330 --> 00:19:42.460
Yes, I am!

00:19:47.830 --> 00:19:49.960
L-Lefiya.

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:52.670
Yes!

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:00.380
Miss Filvis?

00:20:01.000 --> 00:20:06.330
You can summon the magic of your
Elven companions and use it yourself, right?

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.000
Th-that's right.

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:12.250
But only if I have a perfect grasp
of the spell's effect and its incantation.

00:20:17.170 --> 00:20:20.790
Be thee my shield, holy grail of light. Dio Grail!

00:20:22.170 --> 00:20:23.420
That spell from before...

00:20:24.420 --> 00:20:25.330
It's beautiful.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.080
It's a magical barrier.

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:32.330
It can protect the caster and her allies
from a variety of physical and magical attacks.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.540
Lefiya, I entrust this spell to you.

00:20:36.830 --> 00:20:38.250
Miss Filvis...

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:41.330
I want you to come back from this alive.

00:20:45.130 --> 00:20:47.170
I will, I promise!

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.670
Th... Thank you...

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.790
Good job, Bell!

00:20:58.330 --> 00:21:00.330
I think I've got the gist of it.

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:05.330
R-right! Please let me continue the special training
until the Loki Familia leaves on their expedition!

00:21:05.580 --> 00:21:07.540
Please, Goddess!

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:12.040
Fine. If it's that important to you...

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:16.460
However, Miss Wallen-whatsit! I get to observe you two!

00:21:16.670 --> 00:21:17.330
What?

00:21:17.880 --> 00:21:22.330
No calling dibs on my Bell, got it?
It's never gonna happen!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:31.500
Sheesh, she really did a number on you today, huh?
Those were some truly cold-blooded attacks!

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:36.000
That Miss Wallen-whatsit really doesn't
give a darn about you, Bell!

00:21:36.170 --> 00:21:38.420
Nope! That's for sure!

00:21:44.460 --> 00:21:48.670
Compared to the bright main streets,
this way's so nice and dark, isn't it?

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:50.790
Uh, Goddess?

00:21:50.790 --> 00:21:54.830
Bell, make sure you hold my hand
nice and tight now, so I don't fall!

00:21:57.210 --> 00:21:58.290
Miss Ais!

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:10.580
Good morning, open up the window and

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:14.040
You can go anywhere

00:22:14.040 --> 00:22:17.920
A wish you whipser to yourself each day

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:21.920
To keep moving forward as far as you can

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:28.670
You compare yourself to others, let out a sigh

00:22:28.670 --> 00:22:35.040
I know, I know

00:22:36.540 --> 00:22:43.580
Kindness, warmth

00:22:43.580 --> 00:22:47.290
One day the two of you

00:22:47.420 --> 00:22:54.000
Will surely know what it is to love

00:22:54.000 --> 00:23:01.080
The you of tomorrow will turn the you of today

00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.670
Into memories and

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:08.880
Move forwards past them

00:23:09.040 --> 00:23:15.960
The rain will stop, you'll lift your chin up and

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:21.880
You'll be able to say "Thank you" with an honest smile

00:23:21.880 --> 00:23:25.330
Hello, hello, hello

00:23:25.540 --> 00:23:34.130
Sing your love for someone

00:23:37.920 --> 00:23:39.750
"The Boy and The Hero"
